    "author": [{"name":"Michael \"JKat54\" Bentley","email":"michael@bentleypc.com","company":"BentleyPC LLC"}],
    "releaseDate": "10/21/2026",
    "description": "Collects IPMI BMC health data via ipmitool (local open interface). Emits sensor readings and chassis/BMC status as JSON events to index=main (sourcetype ipmi:status), numeric sensor metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype ipmi:metrics, ipmi.* metrics), and new System Event Log records as events (sourcetype ipmi:sel), with IPMI overview and metrics dashboards.",
